    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lost in Backrooms, Drowned in Pools</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liminal Shift</strong> is a unique atmospheric suspense game developed using the latest <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong> technologies such as <strong>Lumen</strong> and <strong>Nanite</strong>. With every step you take, <strong>Liminal Shift</strong> pushes you deeper into an eerie, unsettling experience like no other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/148899eb2721dc11081036ff9c1cf754.poster.avif?t=1752415977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/148899eb2721dc11081036ff9c1cf754.webm?t=1752415977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/148899eb2721dc11081036ff9c1cf754.mp4?t=1752415977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Liminal Shift</strong> it's all about exploring. There is no such monsters or jumpscares in game. It's just you and the environment. Listen, feel and find a way through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can interact with objects around you, allowing you to truly feel immersed in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game delivers an uninterrupted, realistic experience with dynamic transitions; it includes no black screens or loading screens, focusing solely on gameplay and cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound is almost real; with Meta Sound Technology, listen and explore every detail.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/73128e6a1c7f198544be822f94b2026e.poster.avif?t=1752415977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/73128e6a1c7f198544be822f94b2026e.webm?t=1752415977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/73128e6a1c7f198544be822f94b2026e.mp4?t=1752415977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beginning to End</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Liminal Shift, everything revolves around exploration; from start to finish, you experience your very own Backrooms adventure, devoid of puzzles or monsters to flee from. The sole purpose is to progress and hope to find a way out. Liminal Shift features no loading screens, all transitions are seamless, offering an uninterrupted, realistic liminal experience. Prepare for an authentic Backrooms journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/d2a3caeddecb8ea5d86e1a0895bb5edd.poster.avif?t=1752415977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/d2a3caeddecb8ea5d86e1a0895bb5edd.webm?t=1752415977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/d2a3caeddecb8ea5d86e1a0895bb5edd.mp4?t=1752415977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Witness Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Shift takes a contemplative approach to the inception of the Backrooms narrative. It begins in a restful home, but soon, you find yourself within the liminal expanse of the Backrooms universe. This is not just another game about liminal spaces. Liminal Shift offers a plenty of original Backrooms levels to explore, each interpreted through art to evoke a unique sense of tension, realism, and the feeling of being lost in liminal spaces. Will you manage to escape the Backrooms? Or could it be that life within the Backrooms is more peaceful than your normal existence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/8c25e15ebdc46a9a38c716212339f4ae.poster.avif?t=1752415977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/8c25e15ebdc46a9a38c716212339f4ae.webm?t=1752415977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/8c25e15ebdc46a9a38c716212339f4ae.mp4?t=1752415977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Note</strong></u><strong>:</strong> <strong>Liminal Shift</strong> features unsettling enclosed spaces and themes of getting lost in liminal environments, which may cause distress for players with claustrophobia or a fear of disorientation.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lost in Backrooms, Drowned in Pools</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liminal Shift</strong> is a unique atmospheric suspense game developed using the latest <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong> technologies such as <strong>Lumen</strong> and <strong>Nanite</strong>. With every step you take, <strong>Liminal Shift</strong> pushes you deeper into an eerie, unsettling experience like no other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/148899eb2721dc11081036ff9c1cf754.poster.avif?t=1752415977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/148899eb2721dc11081036ff9c1cf754.webm?t=1752415977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/148899eb2721dc11081036ff9c1cf754.mp4?t=1752415977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Liminal Shift</strong> it's all about exploring. There is no such monsters or jumpscares in game. It's just you and the environment. Listen, feel and find a way through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can interact with objects around you, allowing you to truly feel immersed in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game delivers an uninterrupted, realistic experience with dynamic transitions; it includes no black screens or loading screens, focusing solely on gameplay and cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound is almost real; with Meta Sound Technology, listen and explore every detail.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/73128e6a1c7f198544be822f94b2026e.poster.avif?t=1752415977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/73128e6a1c7f198544be822f94b2026e.webm?t=1752415977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/73128e6a1c7f198544be822f94b2026e.mp4?t=1752415977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beginning to End</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Liminal Shift, everything revolves around exploration; from start to finish, you experience your very own Backrooms adventure, devoid of puzzles or monsters to flee from. The sole purpose is to progress and hope to find a way out. Liminal Shift features no loading screens, all transitions are seamless, offering an uninterrupted, realistic liminal experience. Prepare for an authentic Backrooms journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/d2a3caeddecb8ea5d86e1a0895bb5edd.poster.avif?t=1752415977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/d2a3caeddecb8ea5d86e1a0895bb5edd.webm?t=1752415977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/d2a3caeddecb8ea5d86e1a0895bb5edd.mp4?t=1752415977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Witness Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Shift takes a contemplative approach to the inception of the Backrooms narrative. It begins in a restful home, but soon, you find yourself within the liminal expanse of the Backrooms universe. This is not just another game about liminal spaces. Liminal Shift offers a plenty of original Backrooms levels to explore, each interpreted through art to evoke a unique sense of tension, realism, and the feeling of being lost in liminal spaces. Will you manage to escape the Backrooms? Or could it be that life within the Backrooms is more peaceful than your normal existence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/8c25e15ebdc46a9a38c716212339f4ae.poster.avif?t=1752415977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/8c25e15ebdc46a9a38c716212339f4ae.webm?t=1752415977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282700/extras/8c25e15ebdc46a9a38c716212339f4ae.mp4?t=1752415977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Note</strong></u><strong>:</strong> <strong>Liminal Shift</strong> features unsettling enclosed spaces and themes of getting lost in liminal environments, which may cause distress for players with claustrophobia or a fear of disorientation.</p>",
